## # Simple tests
## vm config net 101
## vm config net A # should be 102
## vlans
alias | vlan
A     | 102
## vm config net
[A]
## vm config net B # should be 103
## vlans
alias | vlan
A     | 102
B     | 103
## vm config net
[B]
## vm config net A # should be 102
## vlans
alias | vlan
A     | 102
B     | 103
## vm config net
[A]

## # Manually add aliases
## vlans add foo 200
## vlans add foo 201
E: alias already in use
## vlans add bar 300
## vlans
alias | vlan
A     | 102
B     | 103
bar   | 300
foo   | 200
## vm config net foo
## vm config net
[foo]

## # Tests with namespaces
## namespace foo
## vm config net A # should be 104
## vlans
alias | vlan
A     | 104
## vm config net
[A]
## namespace bar
## vm config net A # should be 105
## vlans
alias | vlan
A     | 105
## vm config net
[A]
## vm config net minimega//A # should be 102
## vlans
alias | vlan
A     | 105
## vm config net
[minimega//A]
## vm config net foo//A # should be 104
## vlans
alias | vlan
A     | 105
## vm config net
[foo//A]
## clear namespace

## # Specify ranges
## namespace foo
## vlans range 130 120
E: expected min > max
## vlans range 120 130
## vm config net B # should be 120
## vlans
alias | vlan
A     | 104
B     | 120
## vm config net
[B]

## # Blacklist
## vlans blacklist
vlan
101
## clear vlans blacklist 101
## vlans blacklist
## clear vlans blacklist 101
E: VLAN 101 is not blacklisted
## clear vlans blacklist 4096
E: invalid VLAN (0 <= vlan < 4096)
## vm config net 333
## clear vlans blacklist 333
E: VLAN 333 is in use by vm config in namespace foo
## clear vm config net
## clear vlans blacklist 333
## vlans blacklist
